    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forgot</strong> is a short anomaly hunting horror game. You play as a boy who is imprisoned at home with his grandparents. But is this really your home and are you sure those are your grandparents?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You want to leave, but no exit leads to the outside. The rooms are looping endlessly and time seems to be standing still. It is midnight and &quot;grandmother&quot; won't let you leave before the morning. She keeps feeding you cake and sends you back to your room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes your surroundings change and sometimes they stay the same... Look out for anomalies and make a decision:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Are there anomalies at home?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cake is poisoned, do <strong>NOT</strong> eat it and leave immediately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Does everything look normal?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cake is <strong>safe</strong>\u00a0and delicious, make sure to eat it on your way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only if you make <strong>12</strong> correct decisions in a row, the morning will come and the path to freedom will open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Playtime: 15 - 60 minutes</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forgot</strong> is a short anomaly hunting horror game. You play as a boy who is imprisoned at home with his grandparents. But is this really your home and are you sure those are your grandparents?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You want to leave, but no exit leads to the outside. The rooms are looping endlessly and time seems to be standing still. It is midnight and &quot;grandmother&quot; won't let you leave before the morning. She keeps feeding you cake and sends you back to your room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes your surroundings change and sometimes they stay the same... Look out for anomalies and make a decision:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Are there anomalies at home?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cake is poisoned, do <strong>NOT</strong> eat it and leave immediately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Does everything look normal?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cake is <strong>safe</strong>\u00a0and delicious, make sure to eat it on your way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only if you make <strong>12</strong> correct decisions in a row, the morning will come and the path to freedom will open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Playtime: 15 - 60 minutes</i></p>",
